    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; \u2013 a 3D Touhou action indie game set in a futuristic city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrator: Niono Myon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; is a developing 3D action indie game featuring characters from the Touhou Project. Players can freely explore the futuristic city. In the future, enemy combat and multiplayer will also be implemented. This game offers a unique gameplay style that allows you to switch between FPS (first-person shooter) and TPS (third-person shooter) perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple operation method-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460 Select a player and start.&quot;\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc\u3092\u9078\u629e\u3057\u3066\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30c8&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461Let's explore the SF world! Multiplayer exploration is possible!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; \u2013 a 3D Touhou action indie game set in a futuristic city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrator: Niono Myon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; is a developing 3D action indie game featuring characters from the Touhou Project. Players can freely explore the futuristic city. In the future, enemy combat and multiplayer will also be implemented. This game offers a unique gameplay style that allows you to switch between FPS (first-person shooter) and TPS (third-person shooter) perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple operation method-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460 Select a player and start.&quot;\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc\u3092\u9078\u629e\u3057\u3066\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30c8&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461Let's explore the SF world! Multiplayer exploration is possible!</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a 3D city and natural forests with Touhou Project characters in this Eastern 3D action indie game. Featuring multiplayer, FPS/TPS view switching, and built with Unity, it delivers an original adventure. Experience intense action in a futuristic city set in the year 2045.",
